      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] **Code Simplicity \u0026 Test Oracle Specificity (`DFU_GETSTATUS` Expectations):**\n\n1. `status_always_idle()` and `ManifestNotIdleStillSucceeds` (lines 876–881) duplicate the same lambda body filling the 6-byte status response. Extracting a small static helper lets both tests share it.\n2. Please specify the expected `kDfuGetStatusResponseLen` length and `kUsbDfuTimeoutMs` timeout arguments instead of wildcard `_` matchers in the `kDfuGetStatus` expectations (matching `RtsUsbDeviceStatusTest::expect_status` at line 446):\n\n```cpp\n\tstatic int fill_idle_status(uint8_t, uint8_t, uint16_t, uint16_t,\n\t\t\t\t    uint8_t *data, uint16_t, unsigned int)\n\t{\n\t\tstd::fill_n(data, kDfuGetStatusResponseLen, 0);\n\t\tdata[kDfuStateOff] \u003d kDfuStateDfuDnloadIdle;\n\t\treturn static_cast\u003cint\u003e(kDfuGetStatusResponseLen);\n\t}\n\n\t/* Every DFU_GETSTATUS reports dfuDNLOAD-IDLE. */\n\tvoid status_always_idle()\n\t{\n\t\tEXPECT_CALL(*backend_,\n\t\t\t    control_transfer(kBmReqD2hClsIf, kDfuGetStatus, 0,\n\t\t\t\t\t    kDfuIf, _, kDfuGetStatusResponseLen,\n\t\t\t\t\t    kUsbDfuTimeoutMs))\n\t\t\t.WillRepeatedly(fill_idle_status);\n\t}\n```\n\nAnd in `PollFailureReleasesInterface` and `ManifestNotIdleStillSucceeds`:\n\n```cpp\nTEST_F(RtsUsbDeviceDownloadTest, PollFailureReleasesInterface)\n{\n\trecord_downloads();\n\tEXPECT_CALL(*backend_,\n\t\t    control_transfer(kBmReqD2hClsIf, kDfuGetStatus, 0, kDfuIf,\n\t\t\t\t    _, kDfuGetStatusResponseLen,\n\t\t\t\t    kUsbDfuTimeoutMs))\n\t\t.WillOnce(Return(-1));\n\tEXPECT_CALL(*backend_, release_interface(kDfuIf)).Times(1);\n\n\tEXPECT_FALSE(device_-\u003edfu_download({ 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6 }));\n\tASSERT_EQ(rec_.blocks.size(), 1u);\n}\n\nTEST_F(RtsUsbDeviceDownloadTest, ManifestNotIdleStillSucceeds)\n{\n\trecord_downloads();\n\tEXPECT_CALL(*backend_,\n\t\t    control_transfer(kBmReqD2hClsIf, kDfuGetStatus, 0, kDfuIf,\n\t\t\t\t    _, kDfuGetStatusResponseLen,\n\t\t\t\t    kUsbDfuTimeoutMs))\n\t\t.WillOnce(fill_idle_status)\n\t\t.WillOnce(Return(-1));\n\tEXPECT_CALL(*backend_, release_interface(kDfuIf)).Times(1);\n\n\tEXPECT_TRUE(device_-\u003edfu_download({ 1, 2 }));\n}\n```\n\nOther locations in this file:\n- **Lines 843–846** (`PollFailureReleasesInterface`)\n- **Lines 873–882** (`ManifestNotIdleStillSucceeds`)\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/c4d18987-0543-4539-89be-1c0e912698a4)",
