      "message": "[Gerrit AI Review] **Testing (Exact Block Payload \u0026 `DFU_CLRSTATUS` Contract Assertions):**\n\n1. In `ImageExactlyOneBlock`, please assert the actual block contents (`EXPECT_EQ(rec_.blocks[0].data, (std::vector\u003cuint8_t\u003e{ 1, 2, 3, 4 }));`) rather than only checking `.size()`.\n2. In `ImageOfExactMultipleOfBlockSize`, please also assert `rec_.blocks[0].data` and `rec_.blocks[2].data.empty()` so both payload blocks and the trailing ZLP are verified.\n3. In `TransferFailureClearsStatusAndReleases` (lines 817–819) and `ShortWriteIsAnError` (lines 832–834), please specify the exact `wValue` (`0`) and timeout (`kUsbCtrlTimeoutMs`) arguments in the `kDfuClrStatus` expectation instead of `_` (matching `ClearStatusSendsRequest` at line 598):\n\n```cpp\nTEST_F(RtsUsbDeviceDownloadTest, ImageExactlyOneBlock)\n{\n\trecord_downloads();\n\tstatus_always_idle();\n\tEXPECT_CALL(*backend_, release_interface(kDfuIf)).Times(1);\n\n\tASSERT_TRUE(device_-\u003edfu_download({ 1, 2, 3, 4 }));\n\tASSERT_EQ(rec_.blocks.size(), 2u);\n\tEXPECT_EQ(rec_.blocks[0].data, (std::vector\u003cuint8_t\u003e{ 1, 2, 3, 4 }));\n\tEXPECT_TRUE(rec_.blocks[1].data.empty());\n}\n\nTEST_F(RtsUsbDeviceDownloadTest, ImageOfExactMultipleOfBlockSize)\n{\n\trecord_downloads();\n\tstatus_always_idle();\n\tEXPECT_CALL(*backend_, release_interface(kDfuIf)).Times(1);\n\n\tASSERT_TRUE(device_-\u003edfu_download({ 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8 }));\n\tASSERT_EQ(rec_.blocks.size(), 3u);\n\tEXPECT_EQ(rec_.blocks[0].data, (std::vector\u003cuint8_t\u003e{ 1, 2, 3, 4 }));\n\tEXPECT_EQ(rec_.blocks[1].data, (std::vector\u003cuint8_t\u003e{ 5, 6, 7, 8 }));\n\tEXPECT_EQ(rec_.blocks[2].number, 2);\n\tEXPECT_TRUE(rec_.blocks[2].data.empty());\n}\n```\n\nAnd in `TransferFailureClearsStatusAndReleases` / `ShortWriteIsAnError`:\n\n```cpp\n\tEXPECT_CALL(*backend_,\n\t\t    control_transfer(kBmReqH2dClsIf, kDfuClrStatus, 0, kDfuIf,\n\t\t\t\t    nullptr, 0, kUsbCtrlTimeoutMs))\n\t\t.WillOnce(Return(0));\n```\n\nOther locations in this file:\n- **Lines 817–819** (`TransferFailureClearsStatusAndReleases`)\n- **Lines 832–834** (`ShortWriteIsAnError`)\n\n[🔗](http://go/tj/c4d18987-0543-4539-89be-1c0e912698a4)",
